⏰ Case 3 – Account Takeover (ATO)

---

🧾 Case Summary

A complaint was received regarding a suspected account takeover.
However, at the time of investigation, the account was already deactivated.

---

🧠 Investigation Process

1. Account Status Check

- The account was checked on the platform
- Result:

❌ Account deactivated

---

2. Limitation Analysis

Due to deactivation:

- No access to profile data
- No activity logs
- No digital trace available

📌 Investigation reached a dead end due to lack of data

---

3. Action Taken

User was advised to:

- Initiate official account recovery
- Contact platform support
- Secure linked credentials

---

⚠️ Case Status

- Inconclusive
- Dependent on platform-level response

---

🧠 Key Learnings (Day 2)

- Legal verification is as important as technical analysis
- Not every complaint is a cybercrime
- Emotional perception can differ from legal reality
- Timing is critical—data loss can stop investigation completely

